# TCL Google TV debloat list — read by scripts/debloat.sh (one package per line, `#` starts a comment).
#
# Method: `pm disable-user --user 0 <package>` — the app stays installed with its data; scripts/rollback.sh (or
# `adb shell pm enable <package>`) brings it back. Nothing is uninstalled, nothing needs root.
#
# Rule for this list (see DEPLOY.md "Where the list comes from"): a line is ACTIVE only if
#   1. at least two independent sources below disable it on TCL TVs, AND
#   2. no source protects it (Free My TV's PROTECTED set, AdrianSantamariaR's catalog "protected": true), AND
#   3. it is a promo / demo / telemetry / manual / unused-extra app, not a TV, input, remote or system piece.
# Lines under OPTIONAL are commented out: real features some people use. Uncomment one to disable it too.
# config/do-not-touch.list is checked before every disable and wins over anything written here.
#
# Sources (all read for this list on 2026-11-26/27; commit = the one read):
#   FMTV  Free My TV, HomeMode.java DEBLOAT[] and PROTECTED — github.com/simbasjungles/free-my-tv @ 0e33f168b8
#   CYTV  CleanYourTV, examples/<tcl-*>/debloat*.txt (95 TCL lists, 92 TCL example folders; "n" = how many lists
#         disable it) — github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv @ be6087056a
#   IMAG  imaginator/TCL-TV-Debloat, disable-tcl-bloatware.sh (Lnn = line) — @ e069e413ae
#   LIVV  livvaa/TCL-Google-TV-Debloat-Optimizer, tcl-debloat-optimizer.ps1 (Lnn = line) — @ a10680aa23
#   ADRI  AdrianSantamariaR/tcl-tv-debloat, tcl_tv_debloat/data/catalog.json (labels, "protected") — @ 9a05dbd73e
#
# Model check for the owner's TCL 50Q651G (Q6 series), read 2026-11-27 — see NIGHT_REPORT.md "50Q651G verification":
#   PR78  CleanYourTV PR #78 (closed, NOT merged; one owner's report): debloat list for a TCL 50Q651G-CA, Android 12,
#         product G10_4K_US_NF — github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv/pull/78, file examples/tcl-q651g-ca-google-tv/
#         debloat.txt @ b74bb63c2b. "PR78" below = that 50-inch set lists (disables) the package.
#   Q651  CYTV examples/tcl-g10-google-tv/debloat.txt (Lnn = line), the notes on a real US 55Q651G (same Q651G line,
#         55-inch, same product G10_4K_US_NF) @ be6087056a: L45-55 (active list used there), L252-264 (its optional
#         lines). "Q651" below = disabled on that 55Q651G.
#   "50Q651G: not confirmed" = neither report lists it; if the set doesn't have it, debloat.sh skips it (harmless).
#
# NOTE: Free My TV's own switch (install-launcher.sh, step "Home Screen -> Free My TV") already turns off several of
# these by itself (marked "FMTV-switch"). Listing them here too is harmless: debloat.sh skips anything already off and
# records only what IT turned off, so rollback.sh and Free My TV's "Original" never step on each other.

# --- SAFE: retail demo / hotel mode
com.tcl.esticker                    # TCL E-Sticker, retail demo stickers. FMTV-switch; CYTV 80; IMAG L14; LIVV L232; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L229
com.tcl.exhibit                     # TCL Exhibit, store demo mode. FMTV-switch; CYTV 24; IMAG L15; LIVV L196; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L228
com.tcl.hotelmenu                   # TCL hotel-mode portal. FMTV-switch; CYTV 19; IMAG L22; 50Q651G: PR78 (55Q651G notes don't list it)

# --- SAFE: promos, nags, telemetry
com.tcl.messagebox                  # TCL push messages and promos. FMTV-switch; CYTV 66; IMAG L16; LIVV L197; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L253
com.tcl.usercenter                  # TCL account sign-in nags. FMTV-switch; CYTV 57; IMAG L19; LIVV L200; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L254
com.tcl.logkit                      # TCL log capture and upload. FMTV-switch; CYTV 37; IMAG L26; LIVV L194; 50Q651G: PR78 + Q651 L45 (ships ENABLED on both)
com.google.android.feedback         # Google "send feedback". CYTV 76; LIVV L205; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L238

# --- SAFE: manuals
com.tcl.repairguide                 # TCL repair guide / self-diagnosis. FMTV-switch; CYTV 29; IMAG L25; LIVV L234; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L233
com.tcl.ocean.instructions          # TCL e-manual. FMTV-switch; CYTV 37; IMAG L24; LIVV L235; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L232

# --- SAFE: preloaded extras that clutter an Apple TV-style home
com.google.android.play.games       # Google Play Games. FMTV-switch; CYTV 64; LIVV L212; 50Q651G: Q651 L257
com.google.android.youtube.tvmusic  # YouTube Music (comment out if you use it). FMTV-switch; CYTV 37; LIVV L249; 50Q651G: not confirmed
com.google.android.videos           # Google TV / Play Movies storefront app. CYTV 51; LIVV L209; 50Q651G: Q651 L258
com.tcl.smartalexa                  # TCL's Amazon Alexa integration (not Google Assistant). CYTV 43; IMAG L32; LIVV L231; 50Q651G: PR78, Q651 L256 (ttvs stays on)

# --- OPTIONAL (commented out = left alone). Uncomment the ones you never use.
# com.tcl.magiconnectfree           # T-Cast / MagiConnect phone mirroring. FMTV-switch; CYTV 14 (12 keep); IMAG L27; LIVV L230
# com.tcl.miracast                  # Miracast screen mirroring. FMTV-switch; CYTV 18 (17 keep)
# com.tcl.ui_mediaCenter            # USB media player. CYTV 38 (14 keep); IMAG L30; LIVV L238
# com.tcl.gallery                   # USB photo gallery + TCL screensaver. CYTV 17 (7 keep); IMAG L17
# com.google.android.syncadapters.calendar  # Calendar sync, no calendar on a TV. CYTV 38; LIVV L206
